# Smoke test — API containerizada (docker compose up -d --build api)
# Pré-requisito: celilac-api Up e celilac-postgres healthy (docker compose ps)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3200

### API respondendo na porta publicada → esperado: 200 OK, "Hello World!"
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Rota inexistente → esperado: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/rota-que-nao-existe
